---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer — UnitConverter">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12 md:py-20">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-canvas-soft-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-mute uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
        Legal
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink mb-5 sm:mb-6 leading-tight">
        Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body leading-relaxed">
        Last updated: January 1, 2025
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-body leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">1. General Information Only</h2>
        <p>
          All information and tools, including unit converters and calculators, provided on UnitConverter ("the Website") are intended for general educational and informational purposes only. We do not provide professional mathematical, scientific, engineering, medical, financial, or legal advice.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">2. Accuracy and Reliability</h2>
        <p>
          While we strive to ensure that all calculations and conversions are precise and up to date, we make no guarantees, representations, or warranties of any kind—express or implied—regarding the accuracy, completeness, correctness, or reliability of any results.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Our calculations use standard mathematical constants and SI factors, but minor rounding differences or variations in conversion definitions can occur.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">3. Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
        <p>
          Any reliance you place on the conversion results obtained from the Website is strictly at your own risk. We strongly recommend that you verify any critical calculations independently, especially when using them for projects, academic examinations, professional engineering layouts, medical dosing, recipe scaling, or financial planning.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall UnitConverter, its operators, developers, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits, revenue, data, or use, incurred by you or any third party, whether in an action of contract or tort, arising from your access to or use of the Website or its tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">5. Third-Party Links and Advertisements</h2>
        <p>
          The Website may contain advertisements served by third-party services, such as Google AdSense, or links to external third-party websites. These advertisements and links do not signify endorsement of any product, service, or opinion. We have no control over the content, privacy policies, or practices of third-party networks or sites and assume no responsibility for them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">6. Changes to the Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to amend, update, or change this Disclaimer at any time without prior notice. We encourage users to check this page periodically for updates. Continued use of the website following any changes constitutes your agreement to the updated disclaimer.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-3">7. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Disclaimer, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@realunitconverter.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">support@realunitconverter.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
